## 📊 Character Limit Management

**Current Rules:** ~{{detection.frameworks.length}} framework-specific + 10 core rules
**Estimated Size:** Varies by project (typically 30,000-80,000 characters)

**Tips to stay within 100K limit:**
1. Use "Apply Manually" as default
2. Activate 3-5 rules max with "Always Apply"
3. Use "Model Decision" for context-aware activation
4. Archive rarely-used rules to a separate directory

