## 📚 Learning More

**Official Documentation:**
- [Qoder Rules Guide](https://docs.qoder.com/user-guide/rules)
- [Quest Mode Documentation](https://docs.qoder.com/user-guide/quest-mode)  
- [Memory System](https://docs.qoder.com/user-guide/chat/memory)

**Understanding Qoder's Memory:**
- **Active Memory:** What you explicitly tell Qoder to remember
- **Automatic Memory:** Learned from your conversations, coding style, and project patterns
- **Rules vs Memory:** Rules take precedence when conflicts occur

**Rule Activation Modes:**
- **Apply Manually:** You control when it's active (right-click in IDE)
- **Model Decision:** Qoder's AI evaluates rule description and decides
- **Always Apply:** Active for every interaction (impacts character limit!)
- **Specific Files:** Active only for matching file patterns

